# interplay_scanout_reset_redo: reset in the middle of a composition on two heads, and the guest starting over. Before: surfaces 1 and 2 rendered on child 1 and shown on heads 0 and 1. reset tears the guest displays down (8 on both pages, the root words cleared) and the task with its mapper textures, so surface 2 now unmaps (nothing holds it) and maps again. The guest redoes everything on fresh pages: both heads connect (4) and take their acks, task 1 and child 1 are defined again, surface 1 is rendered green and surface 2 gets the same triangle as before, and both are presented.
